{"id":"43b779f437ef7b57","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-lottery-sum-forcing.md","title":"ZFC Lottery Sum Forcing","display":"df-zfc-lottery-sum-forcing — ZFC Lottery Sum Forcing","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-lottery-sum-forcing","aliases":["58-df-zfc-lottery-sum-forcing"],"display":"df-zfc-lottery-sum-forcing — ZFC Lottery Sum Forcing","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-forcing]]","[[58-df-sum]]","[[58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-lottery-sum-forcing"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-lottery-sum-forcing</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-lottery-sum-forcing — ZFC Lottery Sum Forcing"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d06ac5a66d69d291\" href=\"?note=d06ac5a66d69d291\" title=\"58-df-forcing\">58-df-forcing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8235a298a67c2370\" href=\"?note=8235a298a67c2370\" title=\"58-df-sum\">58-df-sum</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b5833df5ef175153\" href=\"?note=b5833df5ef175153\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset\">58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(L,\\leq_L,\\mathbf1_L)\">\\((L,\\leq_L,\\mathbf1_L)\\)</span> (lottery-sum forcing)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{P}\">\\(\\mathcal{P}\\)</span> (set of triples <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle P,\\leq_P,\\mathbf1_P\\rangle\">\\(\\langle P,\\leq_P,\\mathbf1_P\\rangle\\)</span> coding forcing posets)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\\)</span> (forcing-poset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b5833df5ef175153\" href=\"?note=b5833df5ef175153\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset\">58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LotterySumForcing}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LotterySumForcing}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}lottery\\text{-}sum\\text{-}forcing} \\vdash \\mathrm{LotterySumForcing}_S(L,\\leq_L,\\mathbf1_L,\\mathcal P)\\leftrightarrow\\left[\\forall\\langle P,\\leq_P,\\mathbf1_P\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P\\;\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\mathbf1_P)\\right]\\land L=\\{\\mathbf1_L\\}\\cup\\{\\langle P,p\\rangle:\\exists\\leq_P,\\mathbf1_P\\;(\\langle P,\\leq_P,\\mathbf1_P\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P\\land p\\in P)\\}\\land\\mathbf1_L\\notin\\{\\langle P,p\\rangle:\\exists\\leq_P,\\mathbf1_P\\;(\\langle P,\\leq_P,\\mathbf1_P\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P\\land p\\in P)\\}\\land\\forall x,y\\in L\\;\\Bigl(x\\leq_Ly\\leftrightarrow y=\\mathbf1_L\\lor\\exists P,\\leq_P,\\mathbf1_P,p,q\\;\\bigl(\\langle P,\\leq_P,\\mathbf1_P\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P\\land p,q\\in P\\land x=\\langle P,p\\rangle\\land y=\\langle P,q\\rangle\\land p\\leq_Pq\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}lottery\\text{-}sum\\text{-}forcing} \\vdash \\mathrm{LotterySumForcing}_S(L,\\leq_L,\\mathbf1_L,\\mathcal P)\\leftrightarrow\\left[\\forall\\langle P,\\leq_P,\\mathbf1_P\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P\\;\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\mathbf1_P)\\right]\\land L=\\{\\mathbf1_L\\}\\cup\\{\\langle P,p\\rangle:\\exists\\leq_P,\\mathbf1_P\\;(\\langle P,\\leq_P,\\mathbf1_P\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P\\land p\\in P)\\}\\land\\mathbf1_L\\notin\\{\\langle P,p\\rangle:\\exists\\leq_P,\\mathbf1_P\\;(\\langle P,\\leq_P,\\mathbf1_P\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P\\land p\\in P)\\}\\land\\forall x,y\\in L\\;\\Bigl(x\\leq_Ly\\leftrightarrow y=\\mathbf1_L\\lor\\exists P,\\leq_P,\\mathbf1_P,p,q\\;\\bigl(\\langle P,\\leq_P,\\mathbf1_P\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P\\land p,q\\in P\\land x=\\langle P,p\\rangle\\land y=\\langle P,q\\rangle\\land p\\leq_Pq\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Conditions from distinct summands are incompatible, while the new top condition lies above every tagged condition.</li>\n<li>The order biconditional is restricted to members of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>, covers the top condition, and remains valid when <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P=\\varnothing\">\\(\\mathcal P=\\varnothing\\)</span>; the outer validity condition is explicitly scoped over the whole family.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-forcing","status":"resolved","id":"d06ac5a66d69d291","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-forcing]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-sum","status":"resolved","id":"8235a298a67c2370","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-sum]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset","status":"resolved","id":"b5833df5ef175153","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset","status":"resolved","id":"b5833df5ef175153","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S$ (forcing-poset predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(L,\\leq_L,\\mathbf1_L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{P}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle P,\\leq_P,\\mathbf1_P\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LotterySumForcing}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}lottery\\text{-}sum\\text{-}forcing} \\vdash \\mathrm{LotterySumForcing}_S(L,\\leq_L,\\mathbf1_L,\\mathcal P)\\leftrightarrow\\left[\\forall\\langle P,\\leq_P,\\mathbf1_P\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P\\;\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\mathbf1_P)\\right]\\land L=\\{\\mathbf1_L\\}\\cup\\{\\langle P,p\\rangle:\\exists\\leq_P,\\mathbf1_P\\;(\\langle P,\\leq_P,\\mathbf1_P\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P\\land p\\in P)\\}\\land\\mathbf1_L\\notin\\{\\langle P,p\\rangle:\\exists\\leq_P,\\mathbf1_P\\;(\\langle P,\\leq_P,\\mathbf1_P\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P\\land p\\in P)\\}\\land\\forall x,y\\in L\\;\\Bigl(x\\leq_Ly\\leftrightarrow y=\\mathbf1_L\\lor\\exists P,\\leq_P,\\mathbf1_P,p,q\\;\\bigl(\\langle P,\\leq_P,\\mathbf1_P\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P\\land p,q\\in P\\land x=\\langle P,p\\rangle\\land y=\\langle P,q\\rangle\\land p\\leq_Pq\\bigr)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P=\\varnothing","display":false}],"bytes":1848,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2504","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-lottery-sum-forcing.md|58-df-zfc-lottery-sum-forcing]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d06ac5a66d69d291","8235a298a67c2370","b5833df5ef175153"]}